Well, then, it's my turn to propose.

Tim's Tribunal (tm) will work as follows:

* Tim (that's me) will act as prosecutor, evidence-gatherer, judge,
jury, appeals court, and executioner. No complications of third parties.

* Upon seeing evidence of General Cluelessness, Stupidity, or Flames
He Doesn't Like, Tim will announce that charges have been filed and a
trial is to begin.

* The accursed will have a chance to defend himself, hopefully
providing even more Cluelessness and Stupidity upon which to convict
