How do you join this PPL system? You don't. Right now, there is only one
member, of course. This is all that is needed, as I don't recall seeing
any points in the ExI statements, or in any discussions of privately
produced law in the past, that PPLs must have some number of members
to be "legit." This PPL only needs one person. Should "more than one"
be needed, by some new ruling, I suspect at least one of you will join
me....I'll let you be the Bailiff, and maybe even prosecute some cases.

I hope you like my new system.

